{"id":"b532ef9903339b7d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/590_动态信念逻辑_Dynamic_Doxastic_Logic.md","title":"590 动态信念逻辑 Dynamic Doxastic Logic","display":"590_动态信念逻辑_Dynamic_Doxastic_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{bel},\\operatorname{rev}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{bel},\\operatorname{rev}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,BA,[*A]B\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,BA,[*A]B\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[*A]B\">\\([*A]B\\)</span> 表示以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 修正后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(BA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[*A]B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\([*A]B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(BA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(BA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{590}([*A]B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{590}([*A]B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{590}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{590}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{590}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{590}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{590}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,590}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,590}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{590}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{590})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{590}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{590})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{590}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{590}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(BA,\\sigma)=B\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(BA,\\sigma)=B\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}([*A]B,\\sigma)=[*\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma)]\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(B,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}([*A]B,\\sigma)=[*\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(A,\\sigma)]\\operatorname{Sub}_{590}(B,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{590}=\\{A\\to(C\\to A):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{590}=\\{(A\\to(C\\to D))\\to((A\\to C)\\to(A\\to D)):A,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{590}=\\{A\\to(C\\to A):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{590}=\\{(A\\to(C\\to D))\\to((A\\to C)\\to(A\\to D)):A,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{590}=\\{(\\neg C\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{590}=\\{(\\neg C\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>信念基底公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{590}=\\{B(A\\to C)\\to(BA\\to BC):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{590}=\\{B(A\\to C)\\to(BA\\to BC):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{590}=\\{BA\\to\\neg B\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{590}=\\{BA\\to\\neg B\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{590}=\\{BA\\to BBA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{590}=\\{\\neg BA\\to B\\neg BA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{590}=\\{BA\\to BBA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{590}=\\{\\neg BA\\to B\\neg BA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>修正归约公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevAt}^{590}=\\{[*A]p\\leftrightarrow(A\\to p):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevAt}^{590}=\\{[*A]p\\leftrightarrow(A\\to p):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590},p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevNeg}^{590}=\\{[*A]\\neg C\\leftrightarrow(A\\to\\neg[*A]C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevNeg}^{590}=\\{[*A]\\neg C\\leftrightarrow(A\\to\\neg[*A]C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevImp}^{590}=\\{[*A](C\\to D)\\leftrightarrow([*A]C\\to[*A]D):A,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevImp}^{590}=\\{[*A](C\\to D)\\leftrightarrow([*A]C\\to[*A]D):A,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevBel}^{590}=\\{[*A]BC\\leftrightarrow(A\\to B(A\\to[*A]C)):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevBel}^{590}=\\{[*A]BC\\leftrightarrow(A\\to B(A\\to[*A]C)):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{590}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{590}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{590}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevAt}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevNeg}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevImp}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevBel}^{590}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{590}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{590}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{590}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevAt}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevNeg}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevImp}^{590}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{RevBel}^{590}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{590}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{590}=\\{((A),BA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{590}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{590}=\\{((A),BA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{590}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{590}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>，并且每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{590}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{590}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{590}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{590}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{590}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{590}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{590}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{590}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\text{ 使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{590}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{590}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\text{ 使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-修正证书\">8. 修正证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"590\">\\(590\\)</span>-修正证书是三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,C,\\rho)\">\\((A,C,\\rho)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\{At,Neg,Imp,Bel\\}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\{At,Neg,Imp,Bel\\}\\)</span>，并指定相应的修正归约公理集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与信念修正更新\">9. 语义结构与信念修正更新</h1>\n<p>先定义非空关系模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\">\\(\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,R,V),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,R,V),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Serial}_{590}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall w\\in W\\ \\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Serial}_{590}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall w\\in W\\ \\exists v\\in W\\ (wRv),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{590}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((uRv\\land vRz)\\Rightarrow uRz),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}_{590}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((uRv\\land vRz)\\Rightarrow uRz),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eucl}_{590}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((uRv\\land uRz)\\Rightarrow vRz).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Eucl}_{590}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\\land \\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((uRv\\land uRz)\\Rightarrow vRz).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>。初始 KD45 信念模型类是该类的子类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DoxMod}_{590}\n=\\{(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}:\n\\operatorname{Serial}_{590}(W,R)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}_{590}(W,R)\\land\\operatorname{Eucl}_{590}(W,R)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{DoxMod}_{590}\n=\\{(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}:\n\\operatorname{Serial}_{590}(W,R)\\land\\operatorname{Trans}_{590}(W,R)\\land\\operatorname{Eucl}_{590}(W,R)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>，定义修正限制</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M*A=(W_A,R_A,V_A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M*A=(W_A,R_A,V_A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_A=\\{w\\in W:\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\},\\quad\nR_A=R\\cap(W_A\\times W_A),\\quad\nV_A(p)=V(p)\\cap W_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_A=\\{w\\in W:\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\},\\quad\nR_A=R\\cap(W_A\\times W_A),\\quad\nV_A(p)=V(p)\\cap W_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系的适用域为所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{590}\\)</span>。它对公式构造树递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{590}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{590}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{590}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}\\neg A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{590}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{590}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathcal M,w\\not\\Vdash_{590}A\\ \\lor\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}BA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,v\\Vdash_{590}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}BA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\,(wRv\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,v\\Vdash_{590}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}[*A]C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\Rightarrow \\mathcal M*A,w\\Vdash_{590}C\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}[*A]C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\Rightarrow \\mathcal M*A,w\\Vdash_{590}C\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>限制三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M*A\">\\(\\mathcal M*A\\)</span> 允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_A=\\varnothing\">\\(W_A=\\varnothing\\)</span>，此时没有指点世界；不对该空载体调用满足关系。在动态子句中，若前条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为真，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W_A\">\\(w\\in W_A\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_A\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W_A\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_A\\subseteq W_A\\times W_A\">\\(R_A\\subseteq W_A\\times W_A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_A\">\\(V_A\\)</span> 具有规定类型，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M*A\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\">\\(\\mathcal M*A\\in\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\\)</span>。若前条件为假，动态公式直接为真。所有实际递归调用都在这个明示的非空关系模型域内，且只评价严格子式；初始 KD45 筛选只用于下列后承，不要求中间模型保持串行性。</p>\n<p>例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\{u,v\\}\">\\(W=\\{u,v\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(u,v),(v,v)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(u,v),(v,v)\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(p_0)=\\{u\\}\">\\(V(p_0)=\\{u\\}\\)</span> 是初始 KD45 模型；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 宣告 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0\">\\(p_0\\)</span> 后，载体为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{u\\}\">\\(\\{u\\}\\)</span>、关系为空。该结果不是串行模型，却仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\">\\(\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\\)</span> 内，后续信念及嵌套修正均可依上述子句求值。</p>\n<p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{590}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{DoxMod}_{590}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{590}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,R,V)\\in\\mathsf{DoxMod}_{590}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{590}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目以 KD45 模型作为初始语义范围，并新增二元动态修正构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[*A]B\">\\([*A]B\\)</span>。更新是按真实前条件作诱导限制；中间求值使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\">\\(\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590}\\)</span>，不要求更新继续满足 KD45。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{DDL}_{590}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{590},\\mathsf{Frm}_{590},\\operatorname{PV}_{590},\\operatorname{BV}_{590},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,590},\\mathsf{Subst}_{590},\\operatorname{Sub}_{590},\\mathsf{Ax}_{590},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{590},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{590},\\mathsf{Proof}_{590},\\vdash_{590},\n\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590},\\mathsf{DoxMod}_{590},*,\\Vdash_{590},\\models_{590}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{DDL}_{590}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{590},\\mathsf{Frm}_{590},\\operatorname{PV}_{590},\\operatorname{BV}_{590},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,590},\\mathsf{Subst}_{590},\\operatorname{Sub}_{590},\\mathsf{Ax}_{590},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{590},\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecB}^{590},\\mathsf{Proof}_{590},\\vdash_{590},\n\\mathsf{RelMod}_{590},\\mathsf{DoxMod}_{590},*,\\Vdash_{590},\\models_{590}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含动态信念逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、KD45 信念模型、修正限制更新和语义后承；不在本条目中断言 AGM 表征定理、可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-修正证书","text":"8. 修正证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与信念修正更新","text":"9. 语义结构与信念修正更新","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{590}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{bel},\\operatorname{rev}.","display":true},{"tex":"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,BA,[*